   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Solidarity, hands and high five for teamwork, success and team building. Group, collaboration and business people with hand together for cooperation, support and synergy, motivation and celebration.</rdf:li>
